In other words, $|\mathrm{Sol}_{S_n}^A([k])|-|k\-Sol_{S_n}^A([k])|=o(|\mathrm{Sol}_{S_n}^A([k])|)$ which immediately implies the claim.\phantom{.} \hfill\scalebox{0.6}{$\blacksquare$} \phantom{.}
